{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o045b","title":"刘备孙权分荆州连和","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o045b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备与孙权和解，以江夏、长沙、桂阳属东，南郡、零陵、武陵属西。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o045b-q"]},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o060a-account","label":"《周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传》正文","text":"益阳会后：刘备割湘水为界罢军","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o060a-q"]},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o084b-account","label":"《周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传》正文","text":"郝普降后：刘备请盟孙权归郝普割湘水还零陵","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o084b-q"]},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o029a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"曹操入汉中刘备求和孙权令诸葛瑾报遂分荆州","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o029a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"议和分地","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o045b-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"议和分地","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o045b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"入汉中","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o029a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0002","role":"奉使","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o029a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"荆州","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o045b-q"]},"time":{"year":215,"label":"曹操定汉中后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y215","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o044","basis":"曹操定汉中后"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o045b-q","xianzhu-q-o044","xianzhu-q-b-e74ba7effc86126dc3fe"]},"source_order":[32,201,"O045b"],"order":6577}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0002","name":"诸葛瑾","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o029a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ae9d96dabf3c33ba272c","layer":"original","quote":"未战，会曹公入汉中〖12〗；备惧失益州，使使求和。权令诸葛瑾报，更寻盟好。遂分荆州：长沙、江夏、桂阳以东属权〖13〗；南郡、零陵、武陵以西属备〖14〗。备归，而曹公已还。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o045b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-1f07331b166b6f2880a1","layer":"original","quote":"先主闻之，与权连和：分荆州江夏、长沙、桂阳东属〖5〗；南郡、零陵、武陵西属。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":200,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":54},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-e74ba7effc86126dc3fe","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-e74ba7effc86126dc3fe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十年：建安二十年（公元 215）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5302047b97c4e4d2cb00","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o044","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-fcd99756379fb59ed6f5","layer":"original","quote":"二十年〖1〗，孙权以先主已得益州，使使报“欲得荆州〖2〗”。先主言：“须得凉州，当以荆州相与。”权忿之，乃遣吕蒙袭夺长沙、零陵、桂阳三郡〖3〗。先主引兵五万下公安，令关羽入益阳〖4〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":199,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o060a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-0db5136062c834176db5","layer":"original","quote":"备遂割湘水为界〖16〗，于是罢军。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o084b-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-dd7fdce0fda1f24e697c","layer":"original","quote":"刘备请盟，权乃归普等〖21〗；割湘水，以零陵还之。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":22,"end":47}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
